{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：16:00 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜75歲生日晒迷人身段  薛家燕偕娛圈猛人到賀星光熠熠  兩大億萬富婆投資有道鬥貴氣\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fba4013814d6aa89c6187086b229a99c/2026-11/ent___1.jpg\"/>\n<p>陳曼娜近日迎來75歲生日，一向投資有道且保養得宜的她，在社交平台大晒多張慶生靚相。相中的陳曼娜留著一頭金色短髮，身穿搶眼桃紅色露肩上衣，搭配同色系大耳環，手捧鮮花容光煥發，狀態極佳，皮膚白滑凍齡。她更感性發文寫道：「今年生日飯局，滿滿的感恩同愛！首先要多謝愛心嘅Melvin哥哥，親自安排地點同美食，搞到有聲有色，更加感謝12位好友，百忙之中都抽空嚟與我共敍，大家傾得特別寫意，食得特別開心！」字裡行間滿溢幸福，網民紛紛送上祝福。</p>\n<h2>陳曼娜與薛家燕兩大富婆同框</h2>\n<p>當晚生日飯局最矚目的，莫過於陳曼娜與另一位圈中富婆薛家燕驚喜同框。兩人當年於經典劇集《十月初五的月光》中分飾霸道潑辣的「萬朱莎華」與溫婉重情的「Q姨」，劇中針鋒相對，私下卻是圈中公認的兩大億萬富婆。一向投資有道的薛家燕盛傳身家早已過億，名下坐擁至少9個物業，包括西半山殷樺花園三個單位、觀塘逾2000呎的「家燕媽媽藝術中心」工廈單位，近年更在中山連掃兩起住宅與佘詩曼做鄰居；而陳曼娜的投資實力同樣不遑多讓，靠精準眼光累積逾億身家，現居紅磡2500呎無敵海景豪宅，她教子有方更為人稱道，女兒鄭祖兒是耶魯大學牙醫博士，兒子Allen更是史丹福及哈佛雙料學霸、現任紐約知名醫院心臟移植外科主管，兩位富婆同場可謂貴氣逼人。</p>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕與陳曼娜私底下經常聚會，打扮時髦有活力，足見兩人的神仙姊妹情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97f2501ca26c745ff37270a95f7c59bf/2026-10/IMG-20230104-WA0007.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕與陳曼娜當年在TVB劇集《十月初五的月光》合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cc73f7ee44704dd32c780956c98e793/2026-10/VS--2--myTVSUPER-17_40_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜迎來75歲生日，與圈中好友兼另一位隱形富婆薛家燕同框，貴氣逼人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/20e87ee95ee2df29f98acf09aa587b87/2026-11/889912688_28969193299386529_7427821618631091050_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃錦燊（左）亦有現身祝賀，外表沒有半點老態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afc7707b2c833ff00f009202929e64e6/2026-11/890616893_28969194312719761_2360219486216631957_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜獲一眾圈中老友大搞生日派對，大家齊聚一堂為她慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f3db6b07b5fc8c9bd4f4f8b795fe7ae/2026-11/891566702_28969193276053198_1559873140529907151_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜與薛家燕及一眾圈中知己於生日飯局上溫馨合影，現場準備了多個精緻的生日蛋糕與壽桃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d3b3491ba5454f5ae066c86d60ac853a/2026-11/892059455_28969193839386475_2633948204681040055_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜手捧鮮花，與驚喜現身的胡楓溫馨同框，留下美好一刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5334f0dc3f3a51b253c28f9de62e9b82/2026-11/892172511_28969193922719800_2591311530040384548_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"胡楓及一眾友人齊聚慶生，陳曼娜金髮配桃紅色露肩上衣，皮膚緊緻狀態大勇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cfba5c1eb7ce17f821d4967814ea1aa6/2026-11/892411602_28969195236053002_7198095954838380499_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"75歲的陳曼娜以一頭金髮搭配搶眼桃紅色上衣，捧著鮮花容光煥發，狀態極佳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2d4369dbd5da5354421cc73d48cc585/2026-11/894503251_28969148212724371_7618704089818242785_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜戴上時髦黃色帽，獲乖孫女獻上甜蜜深情一吻，幸福感滿溢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84a6f2732cd1afd71881971ca4e88df4/2026-11/914942434_29191432503829273_2121624039763025811_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜與可愛的孫仔深情對望，享受家庭溫馨時光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f641010ea56b6a32c102d70c6a392377/2026-11/916920284_29191435323828991_4699749141272641035_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜早前在電台節目中大談投資致富心路歷程，並傳授買樓與租樓防騙秘笈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c7cebe2e2dd87edb5d0563c2a3843316/2026-11/VS--YouTube-BenBensonchur-YouTube-23_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"投資有道的陳曼娜近年在股市變得極為穩陣，並直言買磚頭才是最能由自己掌控的投資方式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ea362027ee93a0f4c9ff9090f415593/2026-11/VS--YouTube-BenBensonchur-YouTube-16_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"近年本港騙案頻生，陳曼娜直言近期在出租物業時，遇到不少出價極高、企圖設下租務騙局的騙子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c05d79174f7510cc3e315af66af1d5c/2026-11/VS--YouTube-BenBensonchur-YouTube-11_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"萬朱莎華經典金句「我萬朱莎華最講道理」至今依然令網民津津樂道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9aff7bb52ac79a33b0aba6ac597c2dbd/2026-10/VS--2--myTVSUPER-18_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕飾演的「朱莎嬌（Q姨）」溫厚重情，深入民心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d62587cb6ab7d32ddd027defc1b7faf/2026-10/VS--2--myTVSUPER-18_24_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當年兩人在劇中飾演性格迥異的親姊妹，連場對手戲火花四濺，至今仍是觀眾心目中的「集體回憶」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70f33dc23d68515d4742ed1d193ef448/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-24_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"經典神劇《十月初五的月光》中，「萬朱莎華」陳曼娜霸氣十足，身旁的「Q姨」薛家燕表情無奈，對比強烈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7219282b927d51a340e6c96084650c7e/2026-10/VS--12--myTVSUPER-26_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"薛家燕、陳曼娜與胡楓同場出席活動，三人皆穿上喜慶紅粉色系盛裝，精神飽滿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7a45f9ed0d4694fb2edc30b4e3534497/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2024-01-19_at_14_10_01_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<h2>胡楓驚喜現身陳曼娜生日飯局</h2>\n<p>除了薛家燕外，當晚亦有不少娛樂圈猛人現身，包括有前「新聞王子」尹錦輝、前TVB戲劇組製作部總監梁家樹、資深傳媒人何麗全及胡楓驚喜現身，現年94歲的胡楓依然精神奕奕，合照時露出慈祥笑容，面色紅潤，完全看不出真實年齡，他的現身為現場增添了不少歡樂。陳曼娜不僅有老友相伴，她亦在其他日子與一對心愛的孫仔孫女甜蜜慶祝，並在社交平台分享合照，相中見戴著黃色帽子的陳曼娜被孫女溫馨錫錫，又與可愛的孫仔深情對望，畫面充滿溫馨，陳曼娜現時半退休的生活，網民紛紛羨慕她是人生勝利組。</p>\n<img alt=\"參與過不少劇集之演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e44417a64009d3eb768581d068a185eb/2023-03/DCENT70416082003.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜身材fit爆。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d4bd39895098a0a8e6c7cbaee0be457/2022-11/MANNA20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜早年為孫女慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77f480ec8468c08a246e2b18e3731a7c/2024-08/456605311_8071519966247167_8505645295697103928_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"屋內空間感好大，放豎琴仍然有大量空間！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5bb92b030338d425b2984b1bea3faef1/2024-08/456722178_8071519356247228_5216803546992490105_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"還有一個大三角鋼琴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/70a825de4381086406badb85ff998cc9/2024-08/456967148_8071519566247207_8500406481782570360_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜有孫萬事足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ac526a245bd1fa0e9889b5a5e518ae08/2024-08/457056822_8071519139580583_2360270669959805341_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜的孫女很可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d048e2827f54286f512aaa2a09149afe/2024-08/457094251_8071519849580512_7864669120705039761_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"收了不少禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d66d20d40114dd11dd402c5ef9e1e1d0/2024-08/457239249_8071520029580494_9216053170902010987_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜生日收到最好的禮物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4ea02c88cc9362f54eadcf12691d056/2023-11/398284290_6783617775037399_5328607979637825691_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜與兒子合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/072dbe7f352e7bae0db034e6c2e5029a/2025-01/472759877_8962299370502551_4810385349655572386_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜的女兒鄭祖兒（Joie）畢業於耶魯大學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/515be17d7822a98720cac4efe64fd69f/2025-01/472775330_8962300013835820_5429556728025052308_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜有孫萬事足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb6b1ac77c9ed617a7956d03e624ef65/2023-11/398308608_6783617481704095_7874239019588785347_n_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜73歲生日與女兒及孫兒一同慶生的照片，場面樂也融融，非常溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e3a469b6c82e7dcdb9a3c5c4fb40a91/2024-11/465455694_8598927030173122_5387471178213806247_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫仔孫女各自戴上粉紅色及淺藍色的生日帽，手舞足蹈地不停拍手，十分可愛精靈，另外枱上亦擺放了「生日快樂」的燈牌及生日蛋糕，還有一大束粉紅玫瑰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5441661343ddf2fc4f9b8feabbe1c119/2024-11/465596802_8598927963506362_7510250123762430496_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫仔孫女十分可愛精靈。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/30ec82afe93549ddfb9953e5dec59943/2024-11/464948397_8598930200172805_7943378134457217784_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"氣氛相當樂融融。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/85dc4f08a36706b8fa7b92f9a6629a81/2024-11/465450196_8598930813506077_8241862173644595515_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"氣氛相當樂融融。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d55b89a9cafeb79adbf518d3e913e8e/2024-11/WhatsApp_Image_2024-11-05_at_6_01_33_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜一對仔女都係學霸，仲好孝順媽咪。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1f07cc0dafaece6dc4e8e881961618f4/2022-06/4458.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜曾赴美探訪兒子一家，入住的豪宅別墅，外觀好有氣派。（受訪者提供）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbbfaf41c32a3282dabe89b52f939854/2022-06/9469b00c-ab70-4c46-9785-9d86f3fe60b5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜住地下全層，無敵巨廳真係無得頂！（受訪者提供）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96aeefc46fc246fef3fda08f560c748e/2022-06/288994943_5206785092720683_6073127691480541719_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"再wide啲....Manna姐話呢啲樓香港「億億聲」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95c6b79eaf41c6d21daf5e2457436077/2022-06/289664783_5206782406054285_2638330443420414597_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"擁有獨立私人泳池，都好基本。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f51ba11d1d8bdb330988e275285cbc04/2022-06/289111309_5206785109387348_1184624238688570054_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"三代同堂去食飯，好溫馨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/192241e60f63a381dc48fd50571c196d/2022-06/289578249_5201285756603950_6731037899315074795_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Manna姐兒子兩年幾前做咗爸爸，誕下混血囡囡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ac17307e28c1710e49dfb97856df3ce/2022-06/289252750_5201285753270617_4858628888046813562_n%20%281%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"孫女好得意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd8cce94ad542c6e9df142f58ef6436d/2022-06/289773514_5206781866054339_8779147609962522275_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜早前再抱孫，更在社交平台大方分享孫仔靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f3c24304a50f5c66c3f3365988fe6b8/2022-11/MANNA13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳曼娜家中飽覽無敵維港靚景。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/018c52d3ffd132222b13340f4dba3c3b/2023-03/74913044_2537396896326196_1483643521226244096_n_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"成日都招呼朋友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e717336f4d4b7da8704108c00149b18/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--YouTube--0%E2%80%9917%E2%80%9D_0.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:23:59.731471+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":810,"images":48,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T08:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T13:37:33.047754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T09:17:26.225439+00:00","content_hash":"11c1db238da604ebf0a5c24d025091913b1c635ac267c47098070f98fb1e31c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}